      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "Unboxed entry with a 2px top rule; amber-to-pink stroke extends on hover or focus.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-card\"><h3><a href=\"#\">CLAT: captura do traço infantil</a></h3><p>Resumo curto do caso de estudo.</p></article>",
      "css": ".ds-card{position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;padding-top:16px;border-top:2px solid var(--color-border,#7388ab);color:var(--color-text,#f2f5fb)}.ds-card::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:-4px;left:0;right:0;height:6px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--trace-slow,#ffb703),var(--trace-mid,#ff6f9f));transform:scaleX(.14);transform-origin:left;transition:transform .45s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}.ds-card:hover::before,.ds-card:focus-within::before{transform:scaleX(1)}.ds-card h3{margin:0;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.4rem;line-height:1.12}.ds-card a{color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:transparent;text-decoration-thickness:2px;text-underline-offset:.2em}.ds-card a:hover,.ds-card a:focus-visible{text-decoration-color:currentColor}.ds-card p{margin:0}"
